{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47137","headline":"句 · 虚中","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜鱼在深处，幽鸟立多时。\n菖蒲花不艳，鸜鹆性多灵。\n盘中是祥瑞，天下恰炎蒸。\n待暖还须去，门前有路岐。\n春雨无高下，花枝有短长。\n老负峨眉月，闲看云水心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虚中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}